verses.simpleExplanation:
Yeh Adhyay 13 ka antim aur phalasruti shlok hai. Bhagavan is poore adhyay ka nishkarsh nikaalte hain.

Jo manushya gyaan-chakshu (vivek-drishti) se yeh samajh leta hai ki shareer nashvar kshetra hai aur aatma anashvar kshetrajna hai, aur jo yeh jaan leta hai ki prakriti ke guno ke bandhan se kaise mukt hua jaata hai;

Vah sansar ke moh-maya ke chakra se chhootkar us sarvochha Param Satya ko prapt karta hai jahan anant shanti aur anand hai.

Yeh shlok mukti ki chaabhi pradan karta hai. Manushya tab tak bandhan mein rehta hai jab tak vah samajhta hai ki "main karta hoon".

Lekin jab sadhak yeh gehrai se dekh leta hai ki shareer aur man ke saare karya prakriti ke teeno guno ki hi paraspar kriyaayein hain, aur aatma in teeno guno se poori tarah pare aur asanga hai;

Tab uska jhootha ahankar toot jata hai. Vah guno ke khel ko ek nishpaksh sakshi ki tarah dekhta hai aur Bhagavan ke sachhe swaroop mein sthit ho jata hai.
